          "explanation": "The authorized trick contains South's CA and West's C3; North holds CQ72 and South retains CK864. Following C2 leaves CQ7, allowing the planned low club to CQ and C7 back toward CK if both defenders follow.",
          "quotes": [
            "Keep the queen as an entry and winner for the next round of clubs.",
