          "explanation": "Authorized history shows CA consumed with both defenders following. South is on lead with CK864 and North has CQ7. C4 to CQ leaves C7 available to lead back toward CK, while DA, HA and SA remain available for recovery if a fourth club must be conceded.",
          "quotes": [
            "Lead to dummy’s queen, preserving the club king and side-suit entries while testing the break.",
            "against 4–1, concede the fourth club and cash the established fifth."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
