        {
          "dimension": "discard_and_entries",
          "fact": "Discarding S2 preserves every necessary winner and the later return to South.",
          "explanation": "Authorized North has no clubs and holds S862, HK74 and D865 under South's established C8. S2 is a legal discard. The retained second spade discard still leaves S8 to lead to South's SA after HK; South also retains C6, DA and HA.",
          "quotes": [
            "Discard an idle spade, preserving dummy’s hearts and diamonds while cashing the clubs.",
            "Cash the club eight and six, discarding two low spades from dummy."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
