      "status": "pass",
      "findings": [
        {
          "dimension": "winner_cashing",
          "fact": "C6 is the final established club, and the remaining plan reaches ten tricks.",
          "explanation": "Authorized history gives five declarer tricks and shows all defender clubs exhausted. South retains C6, DA, HA and SA, while North retains HK and S86. C6 plus those four side winners produces ten total; another low-spade discard leaves S8 for the return to SA.",
          "quotes": [
            "Cash the final club winner, discarding another low spade from dummy.",
            "lead a heart to dummy's king, and cash the spade ace when back in South."
