          "fact": "S6 is expendable and leaves a concrete return entry to South.",
          "explanation": "Authorized North holds S86, HK74 and D865 with no clubs, while South's established C6 is winning. Discarding S6 leaves S8. After the retained DA–HA–heart-to-HK sequence, S8 can be led to South's SA without conceding the lead.",
          "quotes": [
